WEBVTT

00:19:28.996 --> 00:19:30.704
New York City during the pandemic.

00:19:31.413 --> 00:19:32.579
For Mike and his colleagues,

00:19:32.871 --> 00:19:35.913
giving back is deeply embedded in
the Morgan Stanley culture.

00:19:36.454 --> 00:19:39.288
It's always been first class business
in a first class way,

00:19:39.746 --> 00:19:42.663
but also supporting the communities
we operate in.

00:19:42.954 --> 00:19:46.579
You know, this all happened because
of how we felt about them.

00:19:46.996 --> 00:19:51.913
We you know, we just can't believe how
much they do for us. These more people.

00:19:52.496 --> 00:19:54.996
You're not small people to them.
You matter to them.

00:19:57.204 --> 00:19:59.788
At Morgan Stanley, giving
back as a core value,